@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam defaultFontColor #172033
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam noteFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
title Testing closure and deployment handoff
start
:Confirm test basis, candidate and environment;
:Review required functional and security evidence;
:Review Git transport, state and newer feature checks;
:Review manual UI and accessibility observations;
:Review defect retests and regression outcomes;
if (Required evidence complete and no blocking defects?) then (yes)
 :Record acceptance and explicit non-blocking observations;
 :Hand off commit, results and recovery risks to deployment;
else (no)
 :Do not approve release readiness;
 :Assign remaining checks or defect corrections;
endif
stop
@enduml
